      "dcterms:abstract": "We give a simple construction of Markov traces for Iwahori–Hecke algebras associated with the crystallographic Coxeter groups of types An, Bn and Dn. In types B and D, it is new and generalises a known construction in type A employing symmetric polynomials in multiplicative Jucys–Murphy elements.",
